{"4629700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kuiper Wanderer", "steam_appid": 4629700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Kuiper Wanderer</strong></i> invites you on a thrilling retro space adventure. In this highly freeform 2D top-down universe, you will command ships and mechs, assemble your crew, and forge your own interstellar epic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌌 EXPLORE A DYNAMIC SANDBOX UNIVERSE  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/extras/914b6ab0ef6582211e049ac6842a1a15.poster.avif?t=1781234577\" width=1170 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/extras/914b6ab0ef6582211e049ac6842a1a15.webm?t=1781234577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/extras/914b6ab0ef6582211e049ac6842a1a15.mp4?t=1781234577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There is no forced linear path—your story is your own. Chart your course through a sprawling galaxy and choose your profession. Become a wealthy trader, a daring scavenger diving into derelict ruins, or a combat-hardened mercenary. The universe and its economy react dynamically to your decisions, offering true emergent gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚙️ DEEP CUSTOMIZATION &amp; CREW RECRUITMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/extras/6f28cf51827ac63c655426e8f26eeaf6.poster.avif?t=1781234577\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/extras/6f28cf51827ac63c655426e8f26eeaf6.webm?t=1781234577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/extras/6f28cf51827ac63c655426e8f26eeaf6.mp4?t=1781234577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ultimate spacefaring team. The game features deep customization, allowing you to tweak and upgrade various core components of your ships and mechs to face different threats. Along your journey, you will meet and recruit a diverse cast of characters, each with their own unique traits and skills. Tactical synergy and effective command are your keys to surviving the harshness of space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📺 IMMERSE IN CLASSIC RETRO SCI-FI AESTHETICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/extras/cf4af5ba2583068ca3dea2ad59d143f1.poster.avif?t=1781234577\" width=1170 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/extras/cf4af5ba2583068ca3dea2ad59d143f1.webm?t=1781234577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/extras/cf4af5ba2583068ca3dea2ad59d143f1.mp4?t=1781234577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a nostalgic visual style inspired by classic retro science fiction. Combined with satisfying true top-down combat mechanics and old-school UI designs, <i>Kuiper Wanderer</i> delivers an authentic and highly immersive sci-fi experience.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Kuiper Wanderer</strong></i> invites you on a thrilling retro space adventure. In this highly freeform 2D top-down universe, you will command ships and mechs, assemble your crew, and forge your own 