 core components of your ships and mechs to face different threats. Along your journey, you will meet and recruit a diverse cast of characters, each with their own unique traits and skills. Tactical synergy and effective command are your keys to surviving the harshness of space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📺 IMMERSE IN CLASSIC RETRO SCI-FI AESTHETICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/extras/cf4af5ba2583068ca3dea2ad59d143f1.poster.avif?t=1781234577\" width=1170 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/extras/cf4af5ba2583068ca3dea2ad59d143f1.webm?t=1781234577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/extras/cf4af5ba2583068ca3dea2ad59d143f1.mp4?t=1781234577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a nostalgic visual style inspired by classic retro science fiction. Combined with satisfying true top-down combat mechanics and old-school UI designs, <i>Kuiper Wanderer</i> delivers an authentic and highly immersive sci-fi experience.</p>", "short_description": "Kuiper Wanderer is a 2D top-down space sandbox RPG. Command and deeply customize your ships and mechs, recruit a diverse crew, and freely explore, scavenge, or fight in a dynamically evolving universe. Experience highly freeform emergent gameplay wrapped in a classic retro sci-fi aesthetic.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/8c61af78bfbcb0f1cb245fb2ab8efed38c4a8a62/header.jpg?t=1781234577", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4629700/0769259d62783c1c36c